WEBVTT

00:01:29.917 --> 00:01:32.601
and it has the ability to dive repeatedly

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.143
down to the very deepest
point of the ocean.

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:39.351
DB: So like the SpaceX
of ocean exploration?

00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:41.976
VV: Yeah, it's kind of the SpaceX
of ocean exploration,

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:43.684
but I pilot my own vehicles.

00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:45.559
(Laughter)

00:01:45.583 --> 00:01:48.726
DB: Are you going to take Elon or...?

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.809
VV: Yeah, I could take someone down there.

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:52.309
So, Elon, if you're listening,

00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:55.184
I'll give you a ride in mine
if you give me a ride in yours.

00:01:55.208 --> 00:01:57.000
(Laughter)

00:01:58.125 --> 00:02:00.851
DB: So tell us what it's like down there.